ass="sub">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="left_col column"><div class="formatted_description user_formatted"><p><a target="_blank" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4485020/The_Crimson_Hunt/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img title="The Crimson Hunt" alt="The Crimson Hunt" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTc2Njc4LnBuZw==/original/6VVQb9.png" loading="lazy"></a></p>
<figcaption>Steam Page</figcaption>
<p>This is only a demo of the game.</p>
<figcaption>Full game:</figcaption>
<p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4485020/The_Crimson_Hunt/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">https://store.steampowered.com/app/4485020/The_Crimson_Hunt/</a></p>
<h2>Synopsis</h2>
<p>In a world where old legends have been forgotten, the hunter Victoria works in the shadows, eliminating the last remnants of the vampire bloodlines.
 </p>
<p>One night, she receives a new mission: infiltrate a secluded Victorian mansion deep in the woods and rescue a young woman named Eleanor, kidnapped by an ancient vampire who has awakened once more. Upon arrival, Victoria discovers the mansion is far more than a simple refuge &mdash; it is a sanctuary of darkness, infested with vampires, ghouls, and bloodthirsty creatures.
 </p>
<p>Eleanor, weakened but determined, manages to escape her cell and crosses paths with Victoria, forming a fragile and uneasy alliance. Together, they must survive, push through decaying corridors, solve ancient mechanisms, and confront the horrors lurking in every corner.
 </p>
<p>In this third-person survival horror experience, you play as Victoria, a vampire hunter haunted by her past, and Eleanor, a young woman trapped in a nightmare that has only just begun. Together, they must endure grotesque creatures, hidden traps, and a presence that seems to know them better than they realize.
 </p>
<p>Explore oppressive environments, solve environmental puzzles, and carefully manage your resources: ammunition is scarce, light is vital, and every encounter matters. Combine a variety of weapons and tools to adapt to unpredictable enemies, or team up in local split-screen co-op to face the horror together.
 </p>
<p>But survival is only part of the struggle&hellip; As they descend deeper into the mansion, their relationship may prove just as crucial as any weapon in their fight to escape.
 </p>
<p><strong>Survive. Cooperate. Uncover the truth.</strong>
 </p>
<h2>Key Features</h2>
<h3>Modernized Classic Survival Horror</h3>
<p>Explore dark, oppressive environments where danger may hide around every corner. Constant tension and vulnerability are at the heart of the experience.
 </p>
<h3>Third-Person Combat</h3>
<p>Face grotesque creatures using a variety of weapons and tools. Every enemy encounter demands strategy, positioning, and steady nerves.
 </p>
<h3>Character-Driven Narrative</h3>
<p>A story centered on the evolving relationship between its protagonists, where choices, the past, and emotional tension grow alongside the danger.</p>
<h3>Local Split-Screen Co-op</h3>
<p>Experience the full journey with another player. Coordinate strategies, share resources, and face the horror as a team.</p>
<h3>Environment-Driven Puzzles</h3>
<p>Solve environmental and mechanical puzzles to progress. Observation, logic, and exploration are essential.
 </p>
<h3>Resource Management</h3>
<p>Ammunition is limited, healing is scarce, and every item counts. Smart inventory management can mean the difference between life and death.</p>
