tn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/mrj-the-last-survivor"><div style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-red.png)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/mrj-the-last-survivor">Mr.J The Last Survivor</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-10-11 00:23:46"><a href="https://itch.io/post/17568687">25 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p></p><p>Hi Farelas,  I recently came across The Crimson Hunt and I&#x27;m really interested in trying it out.  I was wondering if you would be willing to provide a Steam key for the game. I&#x27;d love to experience it and, if possible, share my thoughts and feedback.  I completely understand if you&#x27;re unable to provide a key, and I appreciate your time and consideration.  Thank you for your work on the game, and congratulations on the release!  Best regards, my YouTube channel:</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCw0ePx5hrP4JphWI0w_yOeQ" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCw0ePx5hrP4JphWI0w_yOeQ</a></p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:7649426,&quot;id&quot;:17515189}" class="community_post has_vote_column" id="post-17515189"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_