ght=&quot;281&quot; src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/OmymTw0g9Ww&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;" style="width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OmymTw0g9Ww/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover"></button></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:988833,&quot;id&quot;:17413049}" class="community_post has_vote_column" id="post-17413049"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/levont"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UyL3VzZXIvOTg4ODMzLzEwNzY3NDcuanBn/25x25%23/o4Hbk1.jpg)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/levont">Levont</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-09-23 01:43:14"><a href="https://itch.io/post/17413049">43 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>Not a bad game. Kinda gives me a og re4/5 feel to it with the partner. I would look into the Eleanor&#x27;s coding when she&#x27;s hurt. I lost a med when she used it while missing 1/4 health. That and the uv flashlight bug where she has a uv flashlight even though I took it from her. Keep it up though.</p><p>Here&#x27;s my channel for other games I have played. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Levont" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.youtube.com/@Levont</a></p><p></p><div><button itchio aria-label="Click to activate YouTube embed" type="button" class="embed_preload youtube_preload" data-embed_code="&lt;iframe width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/xaCGKJVNEHU&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;" style="width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xaCGKJVNEHU/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover"></button></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:15225015,&quot;id&quot;:17409051}" class="community_post has_vote_column" id="post-17409051"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" vers