.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/ss45"><div style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-blue.png)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/ss45">ss45</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-09-22 04:57:36"><a href="https://itch.io/post/17404208">44 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>Hi Farelas, We&#x27;re URB, an Arabic game localization team. We loved&nbsp;the crimson hunt and would love to translate it into Arabic&nbsp; to feature it in our portfolio. Contact us at urbgamesplatform@gmail.com if interested!
