><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>For being only a demo, this seems really promising so far! I quite enjoyed this for what it was and personally cannot wait for the full game! The mechanics were pretty well done so far, the environment and enemies are also well made. Some jankiness exists for sure but nothing that really hinders the experience. Overall, solid demo. Made a video on it.&nbsp;</p><div><button itchio aria-label="Click to activate YouTube embed" type="button" class="embed_preload youtube_preload" data-embed_code="&lt;iframe width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/qY8gxeh87Jw&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;" style="width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qY8gxeh87Jw/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover"></button></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:348144,&quot;id&quot;:16144054}" class="community_post has_vote_column" id="post-16144054"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/fit"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzg0Mzk3OTcucG5n/25x25%23/IKFuUx.png)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/fit">fit</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-05-24 20:40:06"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16144054">164 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>Demo was very good. Creepy setting.&nbsp;</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:12326405,&quot;id&quot;:16139400}" class="community_post has_vote_column" id="post-16139400"><div class="post_anchor" id="last-post"></div><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_up" role="img"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" version="1.1" aria-hidden width="20" class="svgicon icon_vote_down" role="img"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/lonepc"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzMDE2NzQ5LmpwZw==/25x25%23/18uFmc.jpg)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/lonepc">Lonepc</a></span><span class="post_date" title="2026-05-23 23:53:02"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16139400">165 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>Great demo! I can&#x27;t wait for the full release, keep up the good work!&nbsp;</p><div><button itchio aria-label="Click to activate YouTube embed" type="button" class="embed_preload youtube_preload" data-embed_code="&lt;iframe width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/jlMGQ0DI_LQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;" style="width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jlMGQ0DI_LQ/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover"></button></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffarelas.itch.io%2Fthe-crimson-hunt" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><script type="text/template" id="vote_counts_tpl"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class="upvotes">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class="downvotes">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></div></div><div class="right_col column"><div class="video_embed"><div style="padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative;" class="video_embed_widget base_widget" id="video_embed_3085241"><iframe frameborder="0" allowfullscreen style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; right: 0" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/vRxw1bj3FCA"></iframe></div></div><div class="screenshot_list"><a target="_blank" href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDMzMTIxOS8yNzQxNDkwOS5wbmc=/original/aoPP58.png" data-image_lightbox="true"><img data-screenshot_id="27414909" sr